       help: Run it outside a transaction. In Laravel, add "public $withinTransaction = false;" to the migration class.

  3:1  CREATE INDEX j ON orders (y)
       lock   SHARE on orders — blocks writes, allows reads
       cost   full table scan (index build)
  error[create-index-not-concurrently] Building an index without CONCURRENTLY blocks all writes to "orders" until the build finishes.
